## error event: stable Error fields, redacted message, redacted stack
{"v":1,"ts":"2026-11-10T16:38:32.626Z","level":"error","event":"error.server","service":"flower-wms","env":"production","version":"unknown","fields":{},"err":{"name":"Error","code":"P1001","message":"[redacted]","digest":"abc123","stack":"Error: connect [redacted] failed\n    at [eval]:5:91\n    at runScriptInThisContext (node:internal/vm:219:10)\n    at <sanitized stack: 4 more frames>"}}
